cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ProposalBench, please cite it as below."
title: "ProposalBench: an open benchmark for call-conditioned research proposal writing"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Proposia"
    website: "https://proposia.ai"
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/proposalbench/proposalbench"
url: "https://proposia.ai/benchmark"
abstract: >-
  ProposalBench evaluates systems that write research funding proposals from a call and an
  applicant's prior research. It provides 60 public tasks over 12 funding schemes, an open
  scoring harness (deterministic checks, reference verification against scholarly indexes and a
  judge panel from model families no evaluated system uses), and every generated proposal and
  judgment of its November 2026 run.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - large language models
  - LLM evaluation
  - grant proposals
  - scientific writing
  - research funding
